<title>FRANCE: France to sell 400 to 600 mln Ecu bonds Thursday.</title>
<headline>France to sell 400 to 600 mln Ecu bonds Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>France is to offer between 400 and 600 million francs of Ecu-denominated government bonds at its next scheduled auction on Oct 10, the Treasury said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Treasury will offer the current 10-year benchmark OAT, the 7.00 percent April 25, 2006 Ecu OAT and the 6.00 percent March 16, 2001 Ecu BTAN.</p>
<p>Both bonds have a payment date of October 24, the Treasury said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
